  "solution": "Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>A</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>120</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math> nên tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là tam giác tù, suy ra các góc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> là các góc nhọn.<br>Áp dụng định lí sin trong tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> ta có\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>sin</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>120</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>14</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tSuy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>C</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>≈</mo><msup><mn>38</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math> (do góc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> là góc nhọn).<br>Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>B</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>C</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≈</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mn>120</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>38</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>22</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math><br>Áp dụng định lí sin trong tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> ta có\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>sin</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>22</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>120</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>",
